    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2360" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθύσσω</span></b>  (usu. in pres., impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾔθυσσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-αίθυσσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.83
				</span></i>
			): aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρ-αίθυξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>O.</u>
					10(11).73
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.1253
			</span></i>: (akin to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθω</span>):— <i>set in rapid motion, stir up,
				kindle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				542
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.187
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτύπον, νόον,</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				38.382
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				48.689
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>quiver</i>, of leaves, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.31
			</span></i>. </div>
